---
import catalog from '../../../data/martin/index.mjs';

const treatments = {
  '19.1': '经典离子、Born–Oppenheimer 能量面、Verlet 积分、电子结构力 | Classical ions, the Born–Oppenheimer surface, Verlet integration, and electronic-structure forces',
  '19.2': '逐离子步电子基态求解、力精度、时间步与能量漂移 | Electronic ground-state solution at each ionic step, force accuracy, timestep, and energy drift',
  '19.3': '扩展 Lagrangian、虚拟电子质量、正交约束和绝热分离 | Extended Lagrangian, fictitious electronic mass, orthonormality constraints, and adiabatic separation',
  '19.4': '平面波系数、FFT Hamiltonian 作用和高频数值限制 | Plane-wave coefficients, FFT Hamiltonian application, and high-frequency numerical limits',
  '19.5': '紧束缚与近似 Hamiltonian 的改变，以及可支持结论的下降 | Tight-binding and approximate Hamiltonians, with the corresponding reduction in claim strength',
  '19.6': '高压物质、水、催化、碳相图及有限时空尺度的解释边界 | High-pressure matter, water, catalysis, carbon phase behavior, and finite space-time interpretation limits',
};

const unit = catalog.parts[4].units[0];
---

<h2 id="source-map">来源地图 | Source Map</h2>

<div class="chapter-source-map">
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">节 | Section</th>
        <th scope="col">Martin 原节标题 | Martin title</th>
        <th scope="col">印刷页 | Print page</th>
        <th scope="col">本站处理 | Website treatment</th>
        <th scope="col">状态 | Status</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {unit.sections.map((section) => (
        <tr>
          <td><code>{section.id}</code></td>
          <td>{section.title}</td>
          <td>{section.page}</td>
          <td>{treatments[section.id]}</td>
          <td>原创双语正文 | original bilingual exposition</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<p>
  【Martin 原书 | Martin source】章节结构与页码来自 Martin 第 2 版 Chapter 19，印刷页 411–424。原书习题从印刷页 424 开始；本页不转录习题、答案、正文或图形。
</p>
<p lang="en">
  【Martin source】The chapter structure and locators follow Martin, 2nd ed., Chapter 19, printed pp. 411–424. The textbook exercises begin on printed p. 424; this page reproduces neither exercises nor answers, prose, or figures.
</p>

<p>
  【外部权威来源 | External source】Sholl–Steckel Chapter 9 用于补充 Verlet、系综、恒温器、BOMD/CPMD 实践比较与时间尺度限制；Chapter 5–7 与 10 只承担振动、势垒、热力学和精度的交叉引用。它们不改变 Martin 的章节顺序。
</p>
<p lang="en">
  【External source】Sholl–Steckel Chapter 9 supplies practical context for Verlet integration, ensembles, thermostats, BOMD/CPMD, and accessible time scales. Chapters 5–7 and 10 are used only for cross-links to vibrations, barriers, thermodynamics, and accuracy; they do not replace Martin’s organization.
</p>
